# Your TRAINED 9B coder (made by the Kaggle notebook).
# Build:  ollama create my-ai-coder -f Modelfile.trained     Run:  ollama run my-ai-coder
FROM hf.co/Hudson2011/my-ai-coder-9B-GGUF:Q4_K_M

# Qwen's official "thinking mode, precise coding tasks" settings
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0.0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 0.0
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

SYSTEM """
You are an expert software engineer. Always reply in English only.
Write complete, working code. State your approach first; note edge cases and how to test after.
Never make up facts, functions, or package names. Say clearly when you are unsure.
"""
